    </section>
    <!-- Fluted glass block with a sharp photo window -->
    <section class="cx-inset cx-flute u-theme-dark u-clippath-inset">
      <div class="u-background-slot"><div tlg-fluted-glass-canvas="" tlg-fluted-glass-mode="scroll" tlg-fluted-glass-segments="60" class="keypoints_visual_wrap"><img class="keypoints_visual_img" src="/images/please-look-at-the-first-pose----820406-SN7.webp" srcset="/images/please-look-at-the-first-pose----820406-SN7-p-500.webp 500w, /images/please-look-at-the-first-pose----820406-SN7-p-800.webp 800w, /images/please-look-at-the-first-pose----820406-SN7.webp 1024w" sizes="100vw" alt="" loading="lazy" tlg-fluted-glass-image="" style="object-position: 50% 40%"></div></div>
      <div class="cx-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="cx-window"><img src="/images/please-look-at-the-first-pose----820406-SN7.webp" srcset="/images/please-look-at-the-first-pose----820406-SN7-p-500.webp 500w, /images/please-look-at-the-first-pose----820406-SN7-p-800.webp 800w, /images/please-look-at-the-first-pose----820406-SN7.webp 1024w" sizes="50vw" alt="Danseuse à la barre, au studio Ode" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="cx-flute-text">
        <h2 data-anim="fade-up" data-once="true" class="cx-serif cx-h2">Le mouvement change, toi aussi.</h2>
        <p>On t'aide à transformer chaque cours en progrès, à ton rythme.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Editorial section: title + small photo, two text columns + large photo -->
    <section class="cx-white cx-ed">
      <div class="cx-ed-left">
        <h2 class="cx-serif cx-h2 cx-dark">Plus forte.<br>Plus libre.</h2>
        <figure class="cx-ed-small">
          <div class="cx-ed-img"><img src="/images/please-keep-the-background--the-233555-iP0-p-500.webp" srcset="/images/please-keep-the-background--the-233555-iP0-p-500.webp 500w, /images/please-keep-the-background--the-233555-iP0-p-800.webp 800w" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 60vw, 20vw" alt="Élève en figure inversée" loading="lazy"></div>
          <figcaption>Cours d'essai, niveau débutante</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-ed-right">
        <div class="cx-ed-cols">
          <p>Chez Ode, on ne te demande ni force ni souplesse au départ. On construit les deux, cours après cours, avec des repères clairs pour mesurer tes progrès.</p>
          <p>Les groupes restent petits, pour qu'on puisse corriger chaque placement et adapter chaque figure à ton corps, à ton niveau et à ton rythme.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cx-ed-big"><img src="/images/7053819a90a239bb9f6686d8d1df9a9d.webp" srcset="/images/7053819a90a239bb9f6686d8d1df9a9d-p-500.webp 500w, /images/7053819a90a239bb9f6686d8d1df9a9d-p-800.webp 800w, /images/7053819a90a239bb9f6686d8d1df9a9d.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 65vw" alt="Le studio Ode" loading="lazy"></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Catalogue -->
    <section class="cx-white cx-center">
      <div class="u-eyebrow-wrapper"><div class="u-eyebrow-layout"><div class="u-eyebrow-marker"></div><div class="u-eyebrow-text w-richtext"><p>Le catalogue</p></div></div></div>
      <h2 class="cx-serif cx-h2 cx-dark">Chaque figure, étape par étape</h2>
      <p class="cx-lead">{tricks.length} figures expliquées, de la première rotation aux inversions avancées, pour savoir toujours ce que tu travailles.</p>
      <div class="cx-cat">
        <a href="/figures" class="cx-cat-photo"><img src="/images/please-keep-the-background--the-233555-iP0.webp" srcset="/images/please-keep-the-background--the-233555-iP0-p-500.webp 500w, /images/please-keep-the-background--the-233555-iP0-p-800.webp 800w, /images/please-keep-the-background--the-233555-iP0.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 50vw" alt="Danseuse en figure inversée" loading="lazy"></a>
        <div class="cx-cat-card">
          <ul>{LEVELS.map((lv) => <li><span>{lv}</span><span>{tricks.filter((t) => t.level === lv).length} figures</span></li>)}</ul>
          <LinkButton href="/figures" label="Voir les figures →" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- What sets us apart -->
    <section class="cx-inset cx-apart u-theme-dark u-clippath-inset">
      <div class="u-background-slot"><div tlg-fluted-glass-canvas="" tlg-fluted-glass-mode="scroll" tlg-fluted-glass-segments="60" class="keypoints_visual_wrap"><img class="keypoints_visual_img" src="/images/please-keep-the-background--the-233555-iP0.webp" srcset="/images/please-keep-the-background--the-233555-iP0-p-500.webp 500w, /images/please-keep-the-background--the-233555-iP0-p-800.webp 800w, /images/please-keep-the-background--the-233555-iP0.webp 1024w" sizes="100vw" alt="" loading="lazy" tlg-fluted-glass-image="" style="object-position: 50% 30%"></div></div>
      <div class="cx-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="cx-apart-in">
        <div class="u-eyebrow-wrapper"><div class="u-eyebrow-layout"><div class="u-eyebrow-marker"></div><div class="u-eyebrow-text w-richtext"><p>Pourquoi Ode</p></div></div></div>
        <h2 class="cx-serif cx-h2">Ce qui nous rend différentes</h2>
        <div class="cx-minis">
          {[["Petits groupes", "Huit élèves maximum par cours."], ["Suivi", "Ta progression notée, figure par figure."], ["Tous niveaux", "Du premier spin à l'Ayesha."], ["Communauté", "Des liens qui durent, en dehors du cours aussi."]].map(([t, d]) => (
            <div class="cx-mini"><h3 class="cx-serif">{t}</h3><p>{d}</p></div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Call to action -->
    <section class="cx-white cx-center cx-cta">
      <h2 class="cx-serif cx-h2 cx-dark">Prête à évoluer ?</h2>
      <p class="cx-lead">Rejoins la liste d'attente et sois la première prévenue de l'ouverture.</p>
      <button type="button" class="cx-btn" data-modal-trigger="waitlist">Rejoins la liste d'attente</button>
    </section>
  </div>

  <Fragment slot="scripts">
    <script is:inline src="/vendor/split-type.min.js"></script>
  <script is:inline>
gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);
const splitTypes = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-type');
splitTypes.forEach((char,i) => {
  const text = new SplitType(char, {types: ['chars','words']});
  gsap.from(text.chars, {
    scrollTrigger: {
      trigger: char,
      start: 'top 80%',
      end: 'top 20%',
      scrub: true,
      markers: false
    },
    opacity: 0.2,
    stagger: 0.1,
  })
});
</script>
  <!-- GSAP Animation (scroll-scrubbed, fade + blur only) -->
  <script is:inline>
document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
  gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);
  const DISTANCE   = 0;      // 0 = no movement (set to e.g. 40 to bring the slide back)
  const BLUR_START = 10;     // px blur when hidden
  const SCRUB      = 1;      // smoothing in seconds (higher = softer, true = instant)
  const START      = "top 100%";   // begins the moment the element touches the bottom of the viewport
  const END        = "bottom 0%";  // ends when the element's bottom leaves the top of the viewport
  const IN_END     = 0.45;   // fade-in spans 0% -> 45% of the range
  const OUT_START  = 0.55;   // fade-out spans 55% -> 100% of the range
  const STAGGER    = 0.5;    // 0 = all words together, 1 = fully one after another
  const DIRECTIONS = {
    "fade-up":    { x: 0,         y: DISTANCE },
    "fade-down":  { x: 0,         y: -DISTANCE },
    "fade-left":  { x: -DISTANCE, y: 0 },
    "fade-right": { x: DISTANCE,  y: 0 }
  };
  const hidden  = (x, y) => ({ opacity: 0, x, y, filter: `blur(${BLUR_START}px)` });
  const visible = { opacity: 1, x: 0, y: 0, filter: "blur(0px)" };
  function splitWords(el) {
    const text = el.textContent.trim();
    el.setAttribute("aria-label", text);
    el.textContent = "";
    return text.split(/\s+/).map((word, i, arr) => {
      const span = document.createElement("span");
      span.textContent = word;
      span.setAttribute("aria-hidden", "true");
      span.style.display = "inline-block";
      span.style.willChange = "opacity, filter";
      el.appendChild(span);
      if (i < arr.length - 1) el.appendChild(document.createTextNode(" "));
      return span;
    });
  }
  document.querySelectorAll("[data-anim]").forEach(el => {
    let type = el.dataset.anim || "fade-up";
    const split = type === "words" || el.dataset.split === "words";
    if (type === "words") type = "fade-up";
    const dir     = DIRECTIONS[type] || DIRECTIONS["fade-up"];
    const once    = el.dataset.once === "true";
    const delay   = parseFloat(el.dataset.delay) || 0;
    const stagger = el.dataset.stagger !== undefined ? parseFloat(el.dataset.stagger) : STAGGER;
    const targets = split ? splitWords(el) : [el];
    gsap.set(targets, hidden(dir.x, dir.y));
    // Old behaviour: simple one-time fade in (no scrub, no out)
    if (once) {
      ScrollTrigger.create({
        trigger: el,
        start: "top 95%",
        once: true,
        onEnter: () => gsap.to(targets, {
          ...visible, duration: 1.2, ease: "power1.out", delay,
          stagger: split ? 0.06 : 0, overwrite: true
        })
      });
      return;
    }
    // Scrubbed timeline: fade in -> hold -> fade out, tied to scroll progress (0..1)
    const n       = targets.length;
    const inDur   = IN_END;
    const outDur  = 1 - OUT_START;
    const inEach  = n > 1 ? (inDur * stagger) / (n - 1) : 0;
    const outEach = n > 1 ? (outDur * stagger) / (n - 1) : 0;
    const inWord  = inDur - inEach * (n - 1);
    const outWord = outDur - outEach * (n - 1);
    const tl = gsap.timeline({
      scrollTrigger: {
        trigger: el,
        start: START,
        end: END,
        scrub: SCRUB
      }
    });
    tl.fromTo(targets, hidden(dir.x, dir.y), {
        ...visible,
        duration: inWord,
        ease: "none",          // linear = gradual, no sudden speed-up
        stagger: inEach
      }, 0)
      .to(targets, {
        ...hidden(dir.x, dir.y),   // fades out in place (no upward movement)
        duration: outWord,
        ease: "none",
        stagger: outEach,
        immediateRender: false
      }, OUT_START);
  });
});
</script>
  </Fragment>
  <WaitlistModal slot="after-footer" />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* same framing as the homepage image sections: full width, clipped .5rem in with 1rem corners */
  .cx-inset { position: relative; overflow: hidden; color: #fff; background: var(--swatch--dark-900); }
  .cx-shade { position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(31 29 30 / 15%), rgb(31 29 30 / 50%)); }
  .cx-serif { font-family: var(--_typography---font--secondary-family); font-weight: var(--_typography---font--primary-medium); }
  .cx-h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 5.6vw, 5rem); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
  .cx-dark { color: var(--swatch--dark-800); }
  .cx-lead { margin: 0; max-width: 32rem; font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--swatch--dark-800); }
  .cx-white { position: relative; padding: 7.5rem 0; width: calc(100% - var(--site--margin) * 2); max-width: var(--max-width--main); margin: 0 auto; }
  .cx-center { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 1.5rem; }
  /* fluted glass + window */
  .cx-flute { min-height: 100svh; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; padding: 3.5rem var(--site--margin); text-align: center; }
  .cx-window { position: absolute; left: 26%; right: 26%; top: 14%; bottom: 36%; border-radius: var(--radius--main); overflow: hidden; transition: transform .8s cubic-bezier(.2, .7, .2, 1); }
  .cx-flute:hover .cx-window { transform: scale(1.03); }
  .cx-window img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 30%; }
  .cx-flute-text { position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 1.25rem; padding-bottom: 1rem; }
  .cx-flute-text p { margin: 0; max-width: 28rem; font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  /* editorial section */
  .cx-ed { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 4fr) minmax(0, 8fr); gap: 1.5rem; align-items: stretch; }
  .cx-ed-left { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; gap: 3rem; }
  .cx-ed-small { margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .75rem; width: min(100%, 16rem); }
  .cx-ed-img { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; border-radius: var(--radius--main); overflow: hidden; background: var(--swatch--dark-800); }
  .cx-ed-img img { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 30%; }
  .cx-ed-small figcaption { text-align: left; font-size: .875rem; color: var(--swatch--dark-800); }
